From f858a649c7243570a5ebe8b0d8aa7d5e9c2b9b05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:26:24 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): refuse machine kind edits that add turning
 capability

Refuse lathe and mill-turn kind edits on a non-turning machine.
Direct the caller to load a turning machine file.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2602
